          "sourceRegion": "Q54, right column, between the common stem and part (a)",
          "description": "Centred, upright, unshaded flat net. Four corner squares are removed from the original square. The cross outline and central-square folds are solid; the missing outer corner boundaries are dashed. Separate upper-left and lower-left dimensions are both labelled x, and the full horizontal width below is labelled s.",
